From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:59:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: expose Chrome-like PDF plugin and MIME surface

Hardcode the default PDF-enabled desktop profile from Chromium
634b046faf2137b83af71c87baf362b533af9104. Expose native PluginArray,
Plugin, MimeTypeArray and MimeType bindings with legacy properties and
intrinsic array iteration. Cache navigator collections, plugins and
global MIME entries while finalizing fresh plugin-level MIME wrappers.

Preserve per-document Navigator state and owning realms across
WindowProxy reuse, and detach PDF ownership on frame removal and popup
close. refresh(true) schedules the owning frame reload.

This is fingerprint metadata only, not PDF rendering.
